### 1. MLflow Components

| Component | What It Does | Key APIs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Tracking** | Logs parameters, metrics, artifacts per experiment run | `mlflow.log_param()`, `mlflow.log_metric()`, `mlflow.log_artifact()` |
