| Concept | Detail | Exam Tip |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Register** | `mlflow.register_model('runs:/run_id/model', 'catalog.schema.model_name')` | Model stored in UC with governance |
| **Versions** | Each registration creates a new version (v1, v2, v3...) | Immutable — can't modify, only add new versions |
